            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Based on a review of the indexed medical literature (PubMed database), the authors describe the clinical features leading to the diagnosis of first bite syndrome, the pathophysiology of this syndrome and analyse the various treatment options available to otorhinolaryngologists to manage this syndrome.</AbstractText>
